    msg "开发中！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_2ff0a678:

    # "You approach the hooded merchant and he looks up at you, hands holding a handful of coins."
    "你走近那个戴兜帽的商人，他抬头看向你，手里捧着一把硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_7bf76a81:

    # merchant_patron "I'm sorry, but I'm all out of wares for today. Come back next time, my friend."
    merchant_patron "抱歉，我今天的货已经卖光了。下次再来吧，朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_e0861741:

    # merchant_patron "Greetings, traveler! Care to browse wares from distant lands? I have spices, fabrics, and trinkets aplenty."
    merchant_patron "你好，旅行者！要看看来自远方的货物吗？香料、布料和小玩意儿，应有尽有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_6445fdf2:

    # e "Greetings. What are you selling?"
    e "你好。你卖些什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_e81e37f4:

    # merchant_patron "I have the finest goods from all corners of the world, even the most northern lands. Step right up and take a look!"
    merchant_patron "我这里有来自世界各地的上等货物，连最北方的土地来的货都有。快来看看吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_8c0871dd:

    # merchant_patron "My wares are the best on and under this land. You won't find better anywhere else."
    merchant_patron "我的货物在这片土地上、地下都是最好的。你在别处绝对找不到更好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_c7362196:

    # merchant_patron "My inventory expands every day, friend. I assure you, you'll find something new every time you visit."
    merchant_patron "朋友，我的库存每天都在增加。我保证，你每次来都能找到新东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Merchant_Dialogue_7499dd3f:

    # merchant_patron "I have a variety of local goods for sale, friend. Take a look and see if anything catches your eye."
    merchant_patron "朋友，我这里有各种本地货物出售。看看有没有什么能吸引你的目光。"

