translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_847a36e4:

    # "You approach the hooded mage, who is sitting at a table with a few books and scrolls spread out in front of him."
    "你走近那个戴兜帽的法师，他正坐在桌旁，面前摊着几本书和几张卷轴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_1e2abd72:

    # "The mage stares at you with a curious expression, pulling his scrolls away."
    "法师带着好奇的神情盯着你，把卷轴收了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_23fa0a0c:

    # e "What's wrong?"
    e "怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_1b4312db:

    # mage_patron "You don't look like someone who would use a trinket, would you?"
    mage_patron "你看起来不像会用小玩意的人，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_fd873855:

    # "He looks you up and down, then shrugs."
    "他上下打量你一番，然后耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_1dd26958:

    # mage_patron "My apologies for wasted time, the scrolls have no use to you."
    mage_patron "抱歉浪费你的时间了，这些卷轴对你没用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_f0b41a95:

    # mage_patron "Come back when you have a trinket, perhaps the lone alchemist knows a thing or two."
    mage_patron "等你有了小玩意再回来吧，也许那位孤独的炼金术士知道些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_85f0049f:

    # e "Hello, what are you studying?"
    e "你好，你在研究什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_66db6acc:

    # mage_patron "Ah, greetings. I am not studying, actually, I'm just reading some old tomes. I find it quite relaxing while having a mug of beer."
    mage_patron "啊，你好。其实我不是在研究，只是在读几本古书。喝着一杯啤酒看书，我觉得相当放松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_663a541c:

    # mage_patron "In fact, there are some interesting scrolls here that I would like to sell, if you're interested."
    mage_patron "事实上，这里有几张有趣的卷轴，如果你感兴趣，我想把它们卖给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_df7c2e51:

    # e "What kind of scrolls?"
    e "什么类型的卷轴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_d5e1d2a5:

    # mage_patron "Scrolls for you to find trinkets on your way. There are some spare ones that I don't need anymore, so I thought I could sell them to you."
    mage_patron "帮助你在旅途中寻找小玩意的卷轴。我还有几张用不上的多余卷轴，所以想卖给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_6650c1b9:

    # mage_patron "Ah, greetings again. I have some scrolls that might interest you, if you're looking for trinkets to find on your travels."
    mage_patron "啊，又见面了。如果你正在旅途中寻找小玩意，我这里有几张卷轴也许会让你感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_1c3acd91:

    # "The mage flips through his scrolls, then looks up at you with a shrug."
    "法师翻了翻卷轴，然后耸耸肩抬头看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_e405148f:

    # mage_patron "...looks like I don't have any scrolls to sell you right now. Come back later, maybe I'll have something for you."
    mage_patron "……看来我现在没有卷轴卖给你。晚些时候再来吧，也许那时我会有适合你的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_38329e77:

    # mage_patron "Try discovering more places as well, I'll only be able to sell you scrolls for trinkets in places that you have discovered."
    mage_patron "也试着去发现更多地方吧；我只能卖给你在你已经发现的地方找到小玩意所需的卷轴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_2dffbb8d:

    # "The mage flips through his scrolls, then looks up at you with a smile."
    "法师翻了翻卷轴，然后微笑着抬头看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_ded22883:

    # mage_patron "I do have a scroll for you, actually. It's [chosen_scroll.name!t]."
    mage_patron "我确实有一张卷轴给你。是[chosen_scroll.name!t]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_72f75545:

    # mage_patron "[chosen_scroll.scroll.name!t], sounds like something you might be interested in, right? I can sell it to you for... [chosen_scroll.value] gold." nointeract
    mage_patron "[chosen_scroll.scroll.name!t]，听起来像是你会感兴趣的东西，对吧？我可以卖给你……[chosen_scroll.value]枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_2c3098f3:

    # e "I'll take it."
    e "我买了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_03b6bde0:

    # mage_patron "Excellent choice! This scroll will help you find [chosen_scroll.scroll.name!t] on your travels. I'm sure of it."
    mage_patron "不错的选择！这张卷轴会在你的旅途中帮你找到[chosen_scroll.scroll.name!t]。我敢肯定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_b8deded1:

    # e "I'll pass for now, thank you."
    e "这次先不用了，谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_145c020d:

    # mage_patron "No problem, friend. If you change your mind, I'll be here. Perhaps with another scroll."
    mage_patron "没问题，朋友。你改变主意的话，我会在这里。也许到时还有另一张卷轴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Mage_Dialogue_51c21f9c:

    # "The mage returns to his tomes once more."
    "法师再次埋头于他的古书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_52dd390b:

    # "You hear the sound of grunting and cheering as you approach the corner of the tavern."
    "你走近酒馆角落时，听见一阵喘息和欢呼声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_eb8435bc:

    # "A group of patrons are gathered around a table, watching two arm wrestlers go at it."
    "一群客人围在桌边，看着两名扳手腕选手较量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_5000e849:

    # fighter_patron3 "Come on, I bet good money on you! Don't let me down!"
    fighter_patron3 "加油！我可押了不少钱在你身上！别让我失望！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_b886708b:

    # "You watch as the two arm wrestlers struggle against each other, their muscles straining as they try to overpower their opponent."
    "你看着两名扳手腕选手彼此角力，肌肉紧绷着，努力压过对手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_2d627189:

    # "The tension in the air is almost palpable as the two fighters lock eyes, their faces contorted in concentration."
    "空气中的紧张几乎清晰可触；两名选手四目相对，脸上满是专注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_b8011a63:

    # "You can see the sweat dripping down their faces as they strain against each other, their arms trembling with the effort."
    "你能看到汗水从他们脸上滴落；他们奋力相持，手臂因用力而颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_605afbe8:

    # "It looks like a close match, but you can't help but feel a sense of excitement as you watch the two fighters battle it out."
    "看起来胜负难分，但看着两名选手拼斗，你还是忍不住感到兴奋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_2e596eef:

    # fighter_patron1 "Ahh-"
    fighter_patron1 "啊——"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_6bab9b02:

    # "The bull wrestler slams his opponent's arm down on the table, the sound of the impact echoing through the tavern."
    "公牛选手把对手的手臂重重压在桌上，撞击声在酒馆里回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_68c36bfb:

    # fighter_patron2 "I win this round! Pay up, everyone!"
    fighter_patron2 "这一局我赢了！大家付钱吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_0756e218:

    # "The crowd cheers as the bull wrestler raises his arms in victory, a triumphant grin on his face."
    "人群欢呼起来，公牛选手举起双臂庆祝胜利，脸上带着得意的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_187fc1be:

    # "As the bull collects his winning, you notice the coyote walking close to you."
    "公牛收下赌金时，你注意到郊狼走到了你身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_efbb7081:

    # fighter_patron3 "New to the tavern, huh? The bets are open, you want to try your luck?"
    fighter_patron3 "第一次来酒馆吧？赌局开了，要不要试试运气？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_02a20b5a:

    # e "What's the prize?"
    e "奖品是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_bd80172c:

    # fighter_patron3 "This is just some casual bets, how does 10 gold sound? The odds are in the bull's favor, I can tell you that."
    fighter_patron3 "只是随便赌一把，10枚金币怎么样？赔率对公牛有利，这点我可以告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_485f98cc:

    # fighter_patron3 "So, what do you say? Wanna join the bet?"
    fighter_patron3 "所以，你怎么说？要加入赌局吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_db969a51:

    # fighter_patron3 "You're back! Ready to try your luck again?"
    fighter_patron3 "你又回来了！准备再试试运气？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_ceafe9d2:

    # e "I'm ready to bet."
    e "我准备下注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Dialogue_e729cb20:

    # fighter_patron3 "Alright, let's see if you can beat the odds this time."
    fighter_patron3 "好，那就看看这次你能不能赢过赔率。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_1f4fe04b:

    # e "I'll bet on the bull."
    e "我押公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_a1b495a2:

    # e "I'll bet on the hyena."
    e "我押鬣狗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_482f7d77:

    # e "I'll pass."
    e "我不赌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_71274468:

    # fighter_patron3 "Suit yourself, pal. Now, if you'll excuse me..."
    fighter_patron3 "随你的便，伙计。现在，如果你不介意的话……"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_3e49e400:

    # "You watch as the coyote walks back to the crowd."
    "你看着郊狼走回人群。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_ffa0eb13:

    # "You hand the coyote 10 coins, watching as he adds your bet to the pile."
    "你把10枚硬币交给郊狼，看着他把你的赌注加进筹码堆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_ff766b66:

    # "Another round of arm wrestling begins, you watch intently as the two fighters lock arms."
    "新一轮扳手腕开始了，你专注地看着两名选手扣住手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_f91d42d8:

    # "As the two fighters struggle against each other, it's clear that the bull has the upper hand."
    "两名选手角力时，公牛显然占据上风。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_f7236fcd:

    # "It didn't take long for the bull to overpower the hyena, slamming his arm down on the table with a loud thud."
    "公牛很快就压过了鬣狗，把他的手臂重重砸在桌上，发出一声闷响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_beacb5c3:

    # fighter_patron3 "It's a win for the bull again! Pay up, everyone!"
    fighter_patron3 "又是公牛赢了！大家付钱吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_84835364:

    # "The hyena is able to hold his own against the bull, the two fighters locked in a fierce struggle."
    "鬣狗顶住了公牛的力量，两名选手陷入激烈的角力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_0accf055:

    # "Just as the bull slacken to take a breath, the hyena takes the opportunity to slam his arm down on the table, winning the match."
    "公牛刚放松下来喘口气，鬣狗便抓住机会把他的手臂压在桌上，赢下了比赛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_1e84dc26:

    # fighter_patron4 "Ha! I knew you could do it! Pay up, everyone!"
    fighter_patron4 "哈！我就知道你能做到！大家付钱吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_11a317ab:

    # e "A win for me! That was a good fight!"
    e "我赢了！这场打得真精彩！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_e4c766c8:

    # "The coyote hands you 17 coins, a smile on his face as he does so."
    "郊狼把17枚硬币递给你，脸上带着笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_93f89e26:

    # e "That was a close one... I'll get you next time."
    e "真是场势均力敌的比赛……下次我会赢回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_b34690da:

    # "The coyote smiles as he collects your coins, adding them to the pile."
    "郊狼笑着收走你的硬币，把它们加进筹码堆里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Bet_c36056a1:

    # fighter_patron3 "Well, hope to see you again next time."
    fighter_patron3 "好吧，希望下次还能见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Lose_0ae9bcd0:

    # ""
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Fighters_Win_07e37a12:

    # "Winner!"
    "胜者！"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_92edc9a6:

    # "A bit of chattering catches your attention, as you see a pair of patrons sitting at the corner of the tavern."
    "一阵低声交谈吸引了你的注意；你看见酒馆角落坐着两位客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_f7d77414:

    # pair_patron1 "-remember the time we tried to brew our own ale? That was a disaster, worst drink we've ever had."
    pair_patron1 "-还记得我们试着自己酿麦芽酒那次吗？简直是场灾难，是我们喝过最难喝的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_dc9294a3:

    # pair_patron2 "Aye, tasted like straight piss, we were never allowed near the kitchen again, but it's for ol' Lusty's good."
    pair_patron2 "是啊，喝起来简直像尿，我们后来再也不许靠近厨房了，不过这对老卢斯蒂来说倒是件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_c956c5ab:

    # pair_patron1 "You know, I've been thinking about joining the hunters. What do you think?"
    pair_patron1 "你知道吗，我一直在考虑加入猎人。你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_3065a489:

    # pair_patron2 "You? Joining the hunter's guild? You can't even swing a sword properly, let alone take on a quest."
    pair_patron2 "你？加入猎人公会？你连剑都挥不好，更别提接任务了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_b481343d:

    # pair_patron1 "Hey, I can swing a sword just fine! I just... prefer not to. I'm more of a thinker, you know?"
    pair_patron1 "嘿，我挥剑明明很在行！我只是……更喜欢不挥。我比较会动脑子，懂吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_55b37e84:

    # pair_patron2 "A thinker, huh? Well, let's put it this way. They could use more brains than brawn if you don't actively sabotage the team by your mere presence."
    pair_patron2 "会动脑子，是吧？那我换个说法：只要你别光凭存在就把队伍拖垮，他们确实更需要头脑而不是蛮力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_75676063:

    # pair_patron1 "Why do you think the "
    pair_patron1 "你觉得为什么要……"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_38669f3e:

    # pair_patron2 "I thought it was quite fascinating, the name of the tavern. Nocturnal Trunk, it's quite poetic, don't you think?"
    pair_patron2 "我觉得这个酒馆的名字很有意思。夜行树干，很有诗意，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_8b74bde5:

    # pair_patron2 "It's like the night is a tree, and we're all just leaves, hanging on for dear life."
    pair_patron2 "就好像夜晚是一棵树，而我们只是拼命攀附其上的叶子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_519b1996:

    # pair_patron1 "No... the name comes from the tree that grew in the middle of the tavern. There were purple fruits from the tree that glows at night. It was like, one of the three trees that stood from since the primordial days."
    pair_patron1 "不……这个名字来自酒馆中央长着的那棵树。树上结着夜里会发光的紫色果实。它好像是自太古时代起就屹立至今的三棵树之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_dad80cb8:

    # pair_patron2 "Really? I thought it was just a name. I never knew there was an actual tree in here."
    pair_patron2 "真的吗？我还以为那只是个名字。我从不知道这里真的有一棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_d51a5fed:

    # pair_patron1 "It's long gone now, supposedly it began rotting after the moss problems back in the day."
    pair_patron1 "现在早就没了，据说当年的苔藓问题过后，它就开始腐烂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_0342560a:

    # pair_patron1 "You'd think Cane'd change the name, but I guess it's got a nice {i}ring{/i} to it."
    pair_patron1 "你会认为凯恩会改名 但我猜它有一个很好的{i}ring{/i}。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_51acabad:

    # pair_patron1 "You hear about the alleyway brawl last night? I heard it was a real bloodbath."
    pair_patron1 "你听说昨晚小巷里的斗殴了吗？我听说那简直是一场血战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_8b250086:

    # pair_patron2 "Aye, I heard screaming and shouting all night. Sounds like someone's got a bone to pick with someone else."
    pair_patron2 "是啊，我听见整晚都有人尖叫和吵闹。听起来像是有人要找另一个人的麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_578344f9:

    # pair_patron1 "They said that a man came out of the alleyway covered in bruises and cuts, must have been a real fight."
    pair_patron1 "他们说有个男人浑身淤青和伤口地从小巷里走出来，肯定打得很凶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_0f1a400f:

    # pair_patron2 "Who else was there?"
    pair_patron2 "还有谁在那里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_873b4637:

    # pair_patron1 "No idea... I don't dare to go near that place. It sounds like a dangerous place, that alleyway must have hidden a scary secret."
    pair_patron1 "不知道……我可不敢靠近那地方。听起来那条小巷很危险，肯定藏着什么可怕的秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_c23599ae:

    # pair_patron2 "Aye, me neither, best to stay away from there."
    pair_patron2 "我也不敢，最好离那里远点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_8dbe92cc:

    # pair_patron1 "Last time I was in the forest, I saw the blue man... you know, the one with the glowing blue mask."
    pair_patron1 "我上次在森林里看见了蓝面人……就是那个戴着发光蓝色面具的家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_ba0350f8:

    # pair_patron2 "Did you? I've heard stories about him, they say he's looking for something, but no one knows what."
    pair_patron2 "你看见他了？我听过关于他的传闻，据说他在找什么东西，但没人知道是什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_98c6c2c2:

    # pair_patron1 "He is from the goatspeople, I think."
    pair_patron1 "我觉得他是羊人族的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_f639c0c6:

    # pair_patron2 "Wait... aren't all the goats... goats? Is he one of them?"
    pair_patron2 "等等……山羊不都是山羊吗？他也是其中之一？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_2a233f9f:

    # pair_patron2 "Of course when we talk about the goatspeople we mean both the goats and the deers, they're like the same tribe now."
    pair_patron2 "当然，我们说羊人族时，指的是山羊和鹿；他们现在算是同一个部族了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_ba63d2af:

    # pair_patron1 "What's up with the goatspeople? I heard some goats wailing from over the river. They're usually so quiet."
    pair_patron1 "羊人族怎么了？我听见河对岸有些山羊在哀叫。他们平时可安静了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_070427a2:

    # pair_patron2 "I heard some of them went missing. They say the buggbears are behind it, but I don't know if I believe that."
    pair_patron2 "我听说有些羊失踪了。据说是熊地精干的，但我不知道该不该信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_01f6036d:

    # pair_patron1 "Why not? The buggbears are known for their mischief, they could've done it."
    pair_patron1 "为什么不信？熊地精出了名的调皮捣蛋，这事它们完全做得出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_46eeb283:

    # pair_patron2 "They said the missing goats had brought nothing with them, not even a weapon. It's not like them to go out unprepared."
    pair_patron2 "他们说那些失踪的羊什么都没带，连武器也没有。他们可不会毫无准备地出门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_d13ed0c5:

    # pair_patron1 "That's true... but they couldn't have vanished into the thin air."
    pair_patron1 "这倒是真的……但他们总不可能凭空消失吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_864e53d2:

    # pair_patron1 "Have you heard about the goats? They're always around that damn tree for some reason."
    pair_patron1 "你听说那些山羊的事了吗？不知为什么，它们总在那棵该死的树附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_fc79754c:

    # pair_patron2 "The goats? What are they planning?"
    pair_patron2 "那些山羊？它们在谋划什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_37754b72:

    # pair_patron1 "They said they are holding the burials, carrying them to the tree and leaving a mark before they return to the tribe."
    pair_patron1 "听说它们正在举行葬礼，把遗体带到树那里，留下一个标记，然后才回部族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_5d027671:

    # pair_patron2 "Burials? Who died?"
    pair_patron2 "葬礼？谁死了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_808b473d:

    # pair_patron1 "How do I know... do I look like a goat to you?"
    pair_patron1 "我怎么知道……你看我像山羊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_b2f68708:

    # pair_patron2 "Yeah, you're hornier than a goat, that's for sure."
    pair_patron2 "是啊，你可比山羊好色多了，这点毋庸置疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_66edaa5e:

    # pair_patron2 "So, speaking of, what happened to the ol' Lusty's mayor? Do we even have one?"
    pair_patron2 "说到这个，老卢斯蒂的市长后来怎么样了？我们这里甚至还有市长吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_285bb4e8:

    # pair_patron1 "I think the last one died of old age, or maybe he just got tired of the job."
    pair_patron1 "我想上一个是老死的，或者只是当市长当累了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_e6688183:

    # pair_patron2 "And no one's taken his place yet?"
    pair_patron2 "还没人接替他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_8dc9c7db:

    # pair_patron1 "Shhh... Don't you know? The mayor's seat is cursed, no one wants to take it."
    pair_patron1 "嘘……你不知道吗？市长的位子受诅咒了，没人想坐上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_903ff49a:

    # pair_patron2 "Cursed? How so?"
    pair_patron2 "诅咒？怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_05b5a56a:

    # pair_patron1 "They say that when the old mayor died, everyone who tried to take his place met with an untimely end."
    pair_patron1 "听说老市长死后，所有试图取代他的人都不得善终。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_b04513fe:

    # pair_patron2 "That's... unsettling. Maybe we should just leave it empty, then."
    pair_patron2 "这……真让人不安。那也许还是让它空着吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_86603b4d:

    # pair_patron2 "The iron shortage is really starting to affect the town. I heard the blacksmiths are struggling to keep up with demand."
    pair_patron2 "铁矿短缺开始严重影响城镇了。我听说铁匠们都快应付不了需求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_5d01b5b3:

    # pair_patron1 "I heard that too, too bad the werewolves stopped mining their damn ore veins... they could've been our lords right now with the gold they are sitting on."
    pair_patron1 "我也听说了。真可惜狼人停止开采他们那该死的矿脉了……凭他们坐拥的黄金，本来现在都能当我们的领主了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_f84abb2c:

    # pair_patron2 "I don't think they'd be too unhappy about that, they're not exactly the most sociable of creatures."
    pair_patron2 "我觉得他们不会太为此难过，他们本来就不是什么善于交际的生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_b16c41d7:

    # pair_patron1 "Yeah, but they could've been rich! Richer than the king, even."
    pair_patron1 "是啊，但他们本来可以很有钱！甚至比国王还富。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_be78b53f:

    # pair_patron1 "Have you heard about that bard? The one who's been playing in the tavern lately?"
    pair_patron1 "你听说那个吟游诗人了吗？就是最近一直在酒馆里演奏的那个？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_d271d85b:

    # pair_patron2 "Yeah, I've seen that sweet tongue of his, he's got a way with words, that's for sure."
    pair_patron2 "听说了，他那张嘴可真甜，巧舌如簧，这点毋庸置疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_42214967:

    # pair_patron2 "That bard is a real charmer, he smacks his mouth for a few times and everyone's getting tipsy topsy-turvy."
    pair_patron2 "那个吟游诗人真会讨人喜欢，嘴巴动几下，所有人就都醉醺醺、晕头转向了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_1776f808:

    # pair_patron1 "I don't like the kinds of people he brings in, it's getting crowdier upstairs."
    pair_patron1 "我不喜欢他带来的那类人，楼上的人越来越多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_fe8e88ab:

    # pair_patron1 "What's new with the capital? I heard the king's been making some changes."
    pair_patron1 "王都最近有什么新消息？我听说国王做了些改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_65b1c8f0:

    # pair_patron2 "They've started sending out more patrols from the east, I heard. Something about curbing the bandits in the area."
    pair_patron2 "听说他们开始从东边派出更多巡逻队了。好像是为了遏制这一带的强盗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_eb4046c8:

    # pair_patron1 "Is that so? I wonder if they'll come this way next. Lusty's been quiet for too long."
    pair_patron1 "是吗？不知道他们下一步会不会来这边。卢斯蒂已经安静太久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_4c5c9d5f:

    # pair_patron2 "I doubt it, we're too far out of the way for them to bother with us. Maybe quietness is all they needed from us."
    pair_patron2 "我觉得不会，我们离得太偏远，他们没兴趣管我们。也许他们只想让我们继续安静下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_f2e6538d:

    # pair_patron1 "They said the pawnbroker's been acting strange lately, have you noticed anything?"
    pair_patron1 "听说典当商最近举止很奇怪，你注意到了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_0fa88517:

    # pair_patron2 "I don't know, I haven't been there in a while. What's he been doing?"
    pair_patron2 "不知道，我有一阵子没去那里了。他做了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_97c7018a:

    # pair_patron1 "The wall says he's squirming and panting hard, like he's got something to hide."
    pair_patron1 "有人说他扭来扭去，还喘得很厉害，好像有什么东西要藏起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_67af695c:

    # pair_patron1 "Maybe he's just nervous or something."
    pair_patron1 "也许他只是紧张之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_c904c735:

    # pair_patron2 "Not only that, one of the client said he's got something... white on his finger after reaching underneath."
    pair_patron2 "不止如此，有个客人说，他把手伸到下面后，手指上还沾了什么……白色的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_5824c57e:

    # pair_patron2 "I went to the pawn the other day, had to pledge some of my old stuff."
    pair_patron2 "我前几天去了趟当铺，不得不拿一些旧东西去典当。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_e4090b26:

    # pair_patron1 "What did you pledge?"
    pair_patron1 "你典当了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_15c3ffad:

    # pair_patron2 "My family bronze armor, it's been passed down for generations, but I needed the coins."
    pair_patron2 "我家的青铜铠甲，已经传了好几代，但我需要钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_84c802f1:

    # pair_patron1 "You pledged your family armor? Are you mad?"
    pair_patron1 "你把家传铠甲拿去典当了？你疯了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_8e256348:

    # pair_patron2 "I will get it back, the pawnbroker said he'd keep it safe for me. He's not as discourteous as the others said."
    pair_patron2 "我会把它赎回来的，典当商说会替我保管好。他没别人说的那么无礼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_6a24e31d:

    # pair_patron1 "If you say so."
    pair_patron1 "既然你这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_f2550ba5:

    # pair_patron1 "He probably loses more coins drinking beer here, I don't think lack of coin is at issue there."
    pair_patron1 "他在这里喝啤酒大概花掉更多硬币，看来缺钱并不是问题所在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_1a3eac40:

    # pair_patron2 "What's up with those sneak thieves? Are they stealing the beers again?"
    pair_patron2 "那些偷偷摸摸的小偷是怎么回事？他们又在偷啤酒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_cc388c6a:

    # pair_patron1 "Cane just lets them get off scot free. I wonder how much more beer does it take for him to finally kick them off the bar."
    pair_patron1 "凯恩就这么放任他们逍遥法外。我真想知道还得喝掉多少啤酒，他才会终于把他们赶出酒吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Trunk_Pair_Dialogue_06f25f6e:

    # "The dragon patron looks up at you and grins, while the wolf patron nods at you."
    "龙客人抬头朝你咧嘴一笑，狼客人则向你点了点头。"

